note.p:
Telegram 1747 is printed as Document 197. The other
                    telegrams dealt with various aspects of the draft reply to the Soviet note of
                    March 2. (Telegram 1962, Department of State, Central Files, 762.00/3–959;
                    telegrams 1774 and 4654, ibid., 396.1/3–959;
                    telegram 4671, ibid., 396.1/3–1059)
